    "Scan of the 1958 edition of the Old Lyme, Connecticut, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1939; aerial photographs from 1970; photo inspected in 1975; photo revised in 1970; last revised in 1958; printed in 1987.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22 x 26.7 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
